  "forgottenman.dialogue.man.0": "(Well, there is a man here.)",
  "forgottenman.dialogue.man.1": "(He offers you something.)",
  "forgottenman.dialogue.man.2": "(The man nodded vigorously.)",
  "forgottenman.dialogue.man.3": "(He pointed into the distance.)",
  "forgottenman.dialogue.man.4": "(Over there, was another tree.)",
  "forgottenman.dialogue.man.5": "(In fact, it seemed very much like this tree.)",
  "forgottenman.dialogue.man.6": "(Craning your head, you noticed that there was another tree after that.)",
