  "forgottenman.dialogue.man.10": "(He seemed like he wanted to speak, but...)",
  "forgottenman.dialogue.man.11": "(...)",
  "forgottenman.dialogue.man.12": "(Well, the man smiled.)",
  "forgottenman.dialogue.man.13": "(And he waved goodbye, for now.)",
